I split the null and bounds checks, hoisted the profile pointer/index into locals, and marked the invalid paths unlikely so the common valid path stays fall-through.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    auto *p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    const auto idx = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect(idx >= p->numFields, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    return p->fields[idx].num;
}
```